# PitchSwipe scheduled jobs (docs/deploy.md section 3). Runs as the app user; the secret stays in the env file.
*/5 * * * * pitchswipe . /etc/pitchswipe.env; curl -fsS -m 60 -H "Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET" http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cron/assistant >/dev/null 2>&1
0 3 * * * pitchswipe . /etc/pitchswipe.env; curl -fsS -m 120 -H "Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET" http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/cron/audio-cleanup >/dev/null 2>&1
